:285,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":286,"medium-width":29,"medium-height":287,"medium_large":288,"medium_large-width":126,"medium_large-height":289,"large":290,"large-width":129,"large-height":291,"1536x1536":277,"1536x1536-width":282,"1536x1536-height":283,"2048x2048":277,"2048x2048-width":282,"2048x2048-height":283,"woocommerce_thumbnail":292,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":293,"woocommerce_single-width":136,"woocommerce_single-height":294,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":295,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-09-at-11.24.38 AM-150x150.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-09-at-11.24.38 AM-300x197.png",197,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-09-at-11.24.38 AM-768x504.png",504,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-09-at-11.24.38 AM-1024x672.png",672,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-09-at-11.24.38 AM-300x300.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-09-at-11.24.38 AM-600x394.png",394,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-09-at-11.24.38 AM-100x100.png","Consignment is a powerful, low-risk method to sell your valuable items without the hassle of listing, negotiating, or shipping things yourself. Instead of managing the sale process on your own, you partner with a trusted agency like Hidden Treasures. You maintain ownership of your item until it sells, and once it does, you receive a percentage of the final sale price, while we retain a small commission for handling the entire process.\r\nThis approach is popular for a reason: it’s efficient, professional, and ideal for people who want to sell luxury items or collectibles without spending time managing sales platforms or dealing with buyers directly.\r\n","\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>How Consignment Works\u003C/b>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>You bring in or submit your item\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (online or in person).\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u003Cbr />\n\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Example: You have a \u003C/span>\u003Cb>PSA-graded Michael Jordan rookie card\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, a \u003C/span>\u003Cb>Chanel handbag\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, or a \u003C/span>\u003Cb>vintage Rolex watch\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>We provide a complimentary informal appraisal, photograph, and list your item\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on trusted marketplaces, including our high-traffic website, and private collector groups.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>You retain full ownership of the item until it is sold\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Once it sells, you get paid.\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> You receive the majority of the proceeds, and we keep a pre-agreed commission.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>Why Consignment Works So Well\u003C/b>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>✓ No Upfront Fees\u003C/b>\u003Cb>\u003Cbr />\n\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> You pay nothing unless your item sells. There’s no listing fee, no hidden costs—just results. This makes consignment one of the lowest-risk ways to sell high-value items.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>✓ Professional Marketing &amp; Sales Optimization\u003C/b>\u003Cb>\u003Cbr />\n\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We handle professional product photography, compelling descriptions, keyword optimization, and buyer engagement across multiple platforms. This significantly increases visibility and resale value.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>✓ Access to Premium Buyers\u003C/b>\u003Cb>\u003Cbr />\n\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Your item is placed in front of premium buyers through curated listings, verified accounts with over \u003C/span>\u003Cb>500+ five-star reviews\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and exclusive collector and investor groups. That’s exposure you just can’t get selling solo.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>What Can You Sell on Consignment?\u003C/b>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Consignment works best for items with established value and collector demand. Here are some examples:\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Luxury fashion\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Chanel, Gucci, Louis Vuitton, Hermes, and more\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Fine jewelry and watches\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Rolex, Cartier, Omega, Patek Philippe\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Graded sports cards\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: PSA, BGS, SGC-certified items\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Automobiles\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Luxury cars, motorcycles, etc. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Memorabilia\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Signed jerseys, movie props, rare toys\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Collectibles\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Comic books, vinyl records, retro video games\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Art and decor\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Signed prints, limited-edition pieces, designer furniture\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>Who Is Consignment Best For?\u003C/b>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Collectors\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> looking to liquidate high-value items without spending hours managing listings\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Downsizers or estate managers\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> wanting to turn assets into cash\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Fashion lovers\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> cycling out designer pieces\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n\u003Cp>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">\u003Cb>Small business owners\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weig